---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="The private shortlist"
  description="A short list of Andorran professionals for residency, tax, property and banking. Names added only when we would use them."
  path="/shortlist"
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1>The private shortlist</h1>
    <p>
      Empty on purpose until a name has been used, checked, or
      explicitly approved. A blank category is honest. A scraped
      directory is not.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <p>
      This page is the conversion layer. No star ratings. No paid badge
      without a label that it is paid. We do not put a name here unless
      we would hand them a file.
    </p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Category</th>
          <th>Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Gestoria / tax / immigration</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Lawyers and notaries</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Estate agencies, €800k+</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Banks</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>International schools</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Private clinics / specialists</td>
          <td>TBD</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>
      Official websites we have already sourced — banks, a notary, CASS,
      schools, AGIA agents — stay on the
      <a href="/directory">directory</a>.
      That is a separate page. It is not this shortlist.
    </p>

    <h2>How a reader should use this page</h2>
    <p>
      Read
      <a href="/residency-vs-tax">Three things people confuse</a>
      through
      <a href="/the-file">The file and the bank</a>
      first. Then write three sentences: route, budget, days you can
      actually spend. Send those sentences to one gestoria. Two if the
      first will not answer. Not five.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
